    "heating_founder_terms_7j7gcB": {
      "type": "heating-founder-terms",
      "name": "Heating Founder Terms",
      "settings": {
        "text": "<p>Heat levels measured at the inner lining under controlled conditions; actual warmth varies with ambient temperature, wind and layering. Runtime figures measured on the men's Volcano™ Pro heated vest at 41W with fully charged batteries; actual runtime varies with heat level, temperature and battery age. Volcano™ is a mid-layer and provides no abrasion or impact protection; wear it over a base layer rather than against bare skin. A 12V DC vehicle supply and the Y cable set are required for unlimited runtime and are not included. Heating elements carry a three-year warranty and batteries a one-year warranty; Founder Pass holders who reserved before launch have lifetime heating element coverage.</p>"
      }
